      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Telecommunications</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2">Network infrastructure, 5G services, subscriber management, and real-time communications require carrier-grade reliability and automated operations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Logistics</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2">Route optimization, fleet management, warehouse automation, and real-time tracking systems require high-availability platforms with global distribution.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Government</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2">Citizen services, data sovereignty, security classification, and procurement compliance demand reliability practices with stringent audit and control requirements.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Education</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2">Learning management systems, student information systems, and remote learning platforms require reliable access during peak usage periods.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink mb-2">SaaS</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2">Multi-tenant architectures, continuous delivery, customer SLAs, and rapid feature development make SRE practices critical for SaaS platform success.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Media & Entertainment</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2">Content delivery, streaming infrastructure, live events, and global audience distribution demand high-throughput, low-latency platforms with elastic capacity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Artificial Intelligence Platforms</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2">ML model serving, training infrastructure, data pipelines, and GPU cluster management require specialized reliability engineering for AI workloads.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


